  "LVGL 9 swaps the bytes in the flush callback of the display driver, e.g. with lv_draw_sw_rgb565_swap().": "LVGL 9 會在顯示器驅動程式的 flush 回呼函式中交換位元組，例如使用 lv_draw_sw_rgb565_swap()。",
  "LVGL 9.6 deprecated this widget and a later release removes it; prefer a container with a flex layout.": "LVGL 9.6 已棄用此控制項，後續版本將移除；建議改用彈性配置的容器。",
  "LVGL preview not available:": "無法使用 LVGL 預覽：",
  "LVGL runs the code of the export with the real library (LVGL 8.3, or 9.6 for LVGL 9 projects), so the canvas shows exactly what the device draws. Selection frames and the simulator still use the editor's drawing.": "LVGL 會使用實際函式庫執行匯出的程式碼（LVGL 8.3，LVGL 9 專案則使用 9.6），讓畫布精確呈現裝置上的畫面。選取框與模擬器仍使用編輯器繪製。",
  "LVGL version": "LVGL 版本",
  "LVGL {}": "LVGL {}",
  "LVGL {} does not support the following, so it was removed. Undo restores it.": "LVGL {} 不支援下列項目，因此已移除。可透過復原還原。",
  "LVGLab designs user interfaces for LVGL on microcontrollers such as the ESP32 and exports them as C code. This tour shows the main areas in 15 steps. You can leave it at any time and repeat it from the Help menu.": "LVGLab 可為 ESP32 等微控制器設計 LVGL 使用者介面，並匯出為 C 程式碼。本導覽會以 15 個步驟介紹主要區域。您可以隨時離開，並從「說明」選單重新開始。",
  "LVGLab is up to date.": "LVGLab 已是最新版本。",
